        "description": "__Status__ : Alive\n__Age__ : 36 \n__Relatives__ : \nKi Shou (father)\nBa Tei (adopted brother)\nRyuu Tou (adopted brother) \n__State__ : Zhao\n__Residence__ : City of Rigan\n\n\nKi Sui is a General of the Zhao Military forces and the Lord of the City of Rigan.\n\n__Appearance__ : \nKi Sui possesses a wore thinly mustache and beard. He has long brown hair slicked back and sports a white cape.\n\n__Personality__ :\nKi Sui's overwhelming love for his hometown, Rigan inspires his soldiers to fight until the end.\n\n\nSTATS\n__Strength__ : 86\n__Leadership__ : 90\n__Intelligence__ : 90\n__Experience__ : B",
